<title>USA: US Home files $300 mln shelf offering.</title>
<headline>US Home files $300 mln shelf offering.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>US Home Corp filed Thursday with the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission to register a shelf offering of up to $300 million in debt securities.</p>
<p>The Houston-based home builder's shelf offering totals $325 million when combined with previously registered securities.</p>
<p>Proceeds from the sale will be used for general corporate purposes. No underwriters were named in the shelf offering.</p>
</text>
